 "_doc": "Curated synonyms for the kollektiv 1.2.0 seed names (kit35, 22.11.2026). Candidates from Open English WordNet 2024 (GitHub release english-wordnet-2024.xml.gz sha256 e1f633b0...) and the English Wiktionary (kaikki raw dump on the 3070 host), plus derived forms (verify -> validated/unvalidated); senses that do not fit the seed's meaning removed by hand (e.g. verify -> swan, swear). Every name of the diagnostic sets p67ablate/p5ablate/p67prefix is excluded (writer, unchecked, confirmed_by, checked, check, quote, endorse, external, origin, flag, query, absorb, weighs, standing, grade, open, say_plainly, say_guardedly, pending, tally, state, verdict, ...). Frozen before any model answer on renamed-synonym items. Lists made disjoint 22.11.2026 before any model answer (support kept for pos, removed from confirm; corroborate kept for confirm, removed from verify).",
